# OWASP CheatSheetSeries: fetched inside the Docker build only — host AV
# quarantines the XSS payload files (EPERM), so it never lives on host FS.
knowledge-base/sources/OWASP_CheatSheetSeries/
# Same treatment: PayloadsAllTheThings + CSV injection payloads are flagged
# by host AV (CSV formula payloads = macro malware signatures).
knowledge-base/sources/PayloadsAllTheThings/
knowledge-base/sources/csv-injection-payload-list/
# Web-Security-Academy file-upload lab shells (trojan .php) AV-flagged; the
# file-upload-vulnerabilities dir is restored via Docker sparse clone.
knowledge-base/sources/Web-Security-Academy-Series/file-upload-vulnerabilities/

